                "padding-inline-start": 0,
                "padding-inline-end": 0
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_yQC3f9": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "enable_custom_font": false,
                    "custom_class": "title use-rosarivo",
                    "text": "<h2>Explore the Unique Features of Our Miniatures</h2>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "center",
                    "type_preset": "h3",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                },
                "text_8wfHgH": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "enable_custom_font": false,
                    "custom_class": "c",
                    "text": "<p>You don’t need to scroll endlessly to find miniatures that look exactly like the character you have in mind. We design and produce models with the right detail, proportions, and durability—so your choice feels personal. Our collection includes over 5000 DnD-ready sculpts: bards, paladins, monsters, NPCs, and more. All models are made from high-quality resin and undergo manual detailing to ensure sharpness and consistency.</p><ul><li>High durability = perfect for regular play</li><li>Crisp resin details = excellent for painters</li><li>Adjustable sizing = matches your campaign needs</li></ul><p>With 12,000+ five-star reviews, we’re trusted by thousands of players worldwide. And yes, we ship globally - fast.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "center",
                    "type_preset": "custom",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "balance",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                },
                "text_XYbFXE": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "enable_custom_font": false,
                    "custom_class": "hidden-text-1",
                    "text": "<h2>From Classic Heroes to Unique Concepts</h2><p>We’ve worked with sculptors from Artisan Guild, Cast n Play, and other top creators to bring many characters to life. If you’re looking for classic archetypes like the Human Paladin or Female Bard, you’ll find multiple variations that let you match your vision perfectly. Prefer something a bit different? You’ll also discover characters like Tiefling bards, Tortle warriors, and Giff spellcasters -with consistent sculpting quality.</p><p>Need flexibility? Most of our models come in 18 variants, from busts to cavalry.</p><p>Want realism? You’ll notice every cloak fold, facial feature, and piece of gear is visible right out of the box—no cleanup required.</p><h2>Built for Gamers, Painters, and Collectors</h2><p>If you play regularly, you’ll appreciate the sturdiness. If you paint, you’ll enjoy the surface detail and primer-friendly finish. If you collect, you’ll value the hand-crafted quality that comes through in every piece. Our <strong>role-playing miniatures</strong> are printed in-house using high-resolution machines, followed by a finishing process that reduces print lines and improves paint adherence.</p><p>We don’t outsource production. That means more control, faster restocks, and better consistency between prints.</p><p>And if you’ve got your own STL file? Just send it over - we’ll get it printed and shipped to you within 1 week.</p><h2>Monsters, Bosses, and Allies Ready for Any Encounter</h2><p>Planning an epic boss fight or a surprise monster ambush? You’ll find dragons, aberrations, elementals, and more in this collection. Many pieces include dynamic poses, multiple base sizes, and scalable versions to match the scale of your game. Need a single beast or a full battle group? Both are just a few clicks away.</p><ul><li>Creature design = built to match 5e rules</li><li>Huge selection = ready to cover any challenge</li><li>Optional terrain = makes encounters more immersive</li></ul><p>We also offer modular terrain and starter sets, making bringing your full table to life easy.</p><h2>Made by Players Who Get It</h2><p>We started RPG Guild during a late-night session when we realized how hard it was to find durable and good-looking miniatures. Two years later, we’re a team of passionate creators with our production system and a warehouse full of beautifully crafted minis.</p><p>We don’t just sell products—we use them. Every new design is tested at our table. We print, paint, and play before anything gets listed. That means fewer surprises for you and more fun from the start.</p><p>Have a request or idea? Our inbox is open. Custom orders and B2B requests are welcome.</p><h2>Choose Your Perfect Miniature</h2><p>You’re not just picking a miniature. You choose the character representing you for hours of gameplay, storytelling, and fun. Our shop makes that easy with filtered collections by class, race, and monster type. Whether you’re a new player building your first character or a DM running an epic campaign, our selection of <strong>5e miniatures</strong> has something that fits.</p><p>Browse by:</p><ul><li>Class: Bard, Paladin, Rogue, and more</li><li>Race: Elf, Dragonborn, Tiefling, Tabaxi, etc.</li><li>Creature Type: Dragon, Undead, Fey, Giant, and more</li></ul><p>All orders above $60 ship free. Plenty of surprise bonuses are included. Still unsure? Check out our 5-star reviews and see what other adventurers are saying.</p>",
